  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water Resources Management Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The primary objectives of the project are to: (a) increase agricultural production through the provision of reliable irrigation services, (b) increase the financial viability of irrigation and drainage schemes through institutional strengthening, and (c) reduce the risk of dam failures and floods through infrastructure repairs.  In addition, the project aims at achieving the interim (output) objective of contributing to the first step towards the development of comprehensive water resource management.</narrative>
  </description>
